 "hp.s3.h": "Deciding with data",
 "hp.s3.p": "I defined 27 GA4 events to track form submissions and contact clicks, and the analysis showed most traffic was mobile with very short visits. The rebuild plan set the metrics to watch after launch (visits, bounce, CTA clicks, enquiries) up front, and I set a rule to keep bot traffic out of the reported metrics while keeping the raw data in Clarity.",
